# Object Property: <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/affected_by> (affected by)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/affected_by> "describes an entity of which the state or quality is affected by another existing entity.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/affected_by> "https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/BIOLINK")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/affected_by> "affected by")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/affected_by> <https://biolink.github.io/biolink-model/>)

# Object Property: <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/affects> (affects)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/affects> "Describes an entity that has an effect on the state or quality of another existing entity.")
